= The Array of Forces

Our enemies are the <span style="color: #808080;">nationalist</span> <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Stahlhelm**</span>, with [+ sh_strength +] thousand troops, and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>, with [+ sa_strength +] thousand troops. The loyalties of the Reichswehr, with its [+ reichswehr_strength +] thousand regular soldiers, and Prussian police, with [+ prussian_police_strength +] thousand members, are unclear.

On our side, we have the Reichsbanner, at [+ rb_strength +] thousand members.

What else do we have?
  
